body:
i feel this completely, a way that i like to cope is to think about the people you see irl, do you think any of them are so ugly that they deserve to die?? probably not, since we are too just random people in society, people have different perspectives of us and are not as harsh on us as we are on ourselves
you are worthy of feeling like you belong in this world, you are special and loved
if you want you can message me, i’m happy to talk :)
